# Allowlist: everything in the working tree stays out of the VSIX unless it is re-included below.
# Local files (.secrets, .env*, keys, old *.vsix builds, scratch folders), tests, docs, scripts and
# screenshots can therefore never ship by accident. README images are loaded from GitHub.
#
# vsce lets a re-include (!pattern) win over every exclude, so keep each one narrow.
# `npm run verify:package` and the CI "package" job fail if anything else gets into the package.
**

!extension.js
!lib/*.js
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!icon.png
